# Cloudflare Pages rewrites (status 200 = serve the target, keep the URL). Committed, no build.
# The press skins link the apex design system and icon by ABSOLUTE path, because they were
# written to be served from the apex root. Here the apex is mounted at /anecdote.channel/,
# so those two names are rewritten to it. Nothing else is; a name that is not here 404s.
/assets/*   /anecdote.channel/assets/:splat   200
/icon.svg   /anecdote.channel/icon.svg        200
